WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.678 --> 00:00:23.897
Cinderella felt awful.

2
00:00:23.897 --> 00:00:27.393
Her stepsisters were at the fancy ball.

3
00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.512
But she was home alone.

4
00:00:29.512 --> 00:00:32.062
"I wish I could go to the ball."

5
00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:35.179
Cinderella wiped away her tears.

6
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.461
"I must not feel sorry for myself," she said.

7
00:00:38.461 --> 00:00:47.849
"I have lots of work to do."

8
00:00:47.849 --> 00:00:52.124
Cinderella got a rag and a bucket.

9
00:00:52.124 --> 00:00:54.279
She got down on her hands and knees.

10
00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:58.304
And she began to scrub.

11
00:00:58.305 --> 00:01:01.415
Cinderella heard something.

12
00:01:01.415 --> 00:01:05.228
"What was that?" she thought.

13
00:01:05.228 --> 00:01:12.183
She went outside.

14
00:01:12.183 --> 00:01:15.287
There was a small woman at the fountain.

15
00:01:15.287 --> 00:01:19.772
She had sparkling wings.

16
00:01:19.773 --> 00:01:24.059
"Oops," she said. "I'm all wet!"

17
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:29.704
Cinderella gasped. "W-who are you?"

18
00:01:29.704 --> 00:01:33.850
"I'm your fairy godmother," the woman said.

19
00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:38.177
She stood up and flapped her wings.

20
00:01:38.177 --> 00:01:42.229
The fairy flew over to Cinderella.

21
00:01:42.229 --> 00:01:46.272
"I'm here to check on you," she said.

22
00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:50.316
"I wanted to make sure you're okay."

23
00:01:50.316 --> 00:01:52.933
Cinderella stared in surprise.

24
00:01:52.933 --> 00:01:58.965
Suddenly she burst into tears.

25
00:01:58.965 --> 00:02:01.759
"My dear!" the fairy said.

26
00:02:01.759 --> 00:02:04.863
"What's wrong? Tell me!"

27
00:02:04.863 --> 00:02:07.982
"I'm not okay," Cinderella said.

28
00:02:07.982 --> 00:02:10.082
"My life is terrible!

29
00:02:10.082 --> 00:02:12.473
I work and work and work.

30
00:02:12.473 --> 00:02:14.785
And tonight . . ."

31
00:02:14.785 --> 00:02:19.215
"You want to go to the ball," the fairy said.

32
00:02:19.215 --> 00:02:23.439
Cinderella sniffed. "Yes, but—"

33
00:02:23.439 --> 00:02:31.390
The fairy smiled brightly. "Then you will go!"
